<body>
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="/es/">LayerPorter</a>
    <div class="site-header-right">
      <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Main">
        <a href="/convert/">Herramientas online</a>
        <a href="/es/extensions/" aria-current="page">Extensiones</a>
        <a href="/guides/">Guías</a>
      </nav>
      <span class="local-pill"><span class="local-pill-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Local engine</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
<main class="wrap">
<div class="extensions-hub">
<section class="extensions-hero">
  <span class="extensions-kicker">Extensiones de Chrome</span>
  <h1>Extensiones de Chrome para descargar y convertir imágenes</h1>
  <p>Dos herramientas concretas. Descarga contenido de Pinterest o elige una imagen de un sitio web o de tu ordenador y guárdala en el formato que necesitas.</p>
</section>
<section class="extensions-grid" aria-label="Extensiones de Chrome">
<article class="extension-product">
  <div class="extension-product-visual pinterest" aria-label="Descargar Pinterest">
    <div class="ux-window">
      <div class="ux-window-head">
        <div class="ux-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        <div class="ux-url">pinterest.com / board / references</div>
        <div class="ux-extension-icon"><img src="/pinterest-downloader/icon-128.png" alt="" width="21" height="21" decoding="async" /></div>
      </div>
      <div class="pd-workspace">
        <div class="pd-page">
          <div class="pd-page-head"><b>Pinterest</b><span>Tablero</span></div>
          <div class="pd-pins">
            <div class="pd-pin tall"><img src="/images/home/fashion-reference-320.webp" srcset="/images/home/fashion-reference-320.webp 320w, /images/home/fashion-reference-640.webp 640w" sizes="110px" alt="" width="320" height="443" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-pin-action">↓</span></div>
            <div class="pd-pin"><img src="/images/home/travel-reference-320.webp" srcset="/images/home/travel-reference-320.webp 320w, /images/home/travel-reference-640.webp 640w" sizes="110px" alt="" width="320" height="213" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-pin-action">↓</span></div>
            <div class="pd-pin"><img src="/images/home/workspace-reference-320.webp" srcset="/images/home/workspace-reference-320.webp 320w, /images/home/workspace-reference-640.webp 640w" sizes="110px" alt="" width="320" height="214" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-pin-action">↓</span></div>
            <div class="pd-pin tall"><img src="/images/home/fashion-board-reference-320.webp" srcset="/images/home/fashion-board-reference-320.webp 320w, /images/home/fashion-board-reference-640.webp 640w" sizes="110px" alt="" width="320" height="213" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-pin-action">↓</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pd-panel">
          <div class="pd-entry">
            <div class="pd-web-card"><span class="pd-web-icon">←</span><span class="pd-web-copy"><b>Elegir una imagen o vídeo</b><small>Haz clic en una imagen o vídeo de la página</small></span><span class="pd-web-go">◎</span></div>
            <div class="pd-web-card"><span class="pd-web-icon">▦</span><span class="pd-web-copy"><b>Encontrar todas las imágenes de esta página</b><small>Analizar la página, los frames y las imágenes con carga diferida</small></span><span class="pd-web-go">→</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="pd-bulk">
            <div class="pd-bulk-head"><button class="pd-bulk-btn" type="button" tabindex="-1">←</button><div class="pd-bulk-title"><b>Imágenes de la página</b><small>24 imágenes encontradas</small></div><button class="pd-bulk-btn" type="button" tabindex="-1">↻</button><button class="pd-bulk-btn" type="button" tabindex="-1">≡</button></div>
            <div class="pd-bulk-actions"><span>Seleccionar todo</span><span>Limpiar</span><span>6 seleccionadas</span></div>
            <div class="pd-bulk-grid">
              <div class="pd-bulk-card"><img src="/images/home/fashion-reference-320.webp" alt="" width="320" height="443" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-tick">✓</span></div>
              <div class="pd-bulk-card"><img src="/images/home/travel-reference-320.webp" alt="" width="320" height="213" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-tick">✓</span></div>
              <div class="pd-bulk-card"><img src="/images/home/workspace-reference-320.webp" alt="" width="320" height="214" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-tick">✓</span></div>
              <div class="pd-bulk-card"><img src="/images/home/fashion-board-reference-320.webp" alt="" width="320" height="213" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-tick">✓</span></div>
              <div class="pd-bulk-card"><img src="/images/home/fashion-reference-320.webp" alt="" width="320" height="443" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-tick">✓</span></div>
              <div class="pd-bulk-card"><img src="/images/home/travel-reference-320.webp" alt="" width="320" height="213" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-tick">✓</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pd-download-bar">
              <div class="pd-download-row"><div class="pd-save"><label>Guardar como</label><select class="pd-select" tabindex="-1"><option>Original</option></select></div><div class="pd-download-split"><button class="pd-download-main" type="button" tabindex="-1">Descargar</button><button class="pd-download-more" type="button" tabindex="-1">⌄</button></div></div>
              <div class="pd-download-meta">Descargar en carpeta · Crear ZIP</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="extension-product-copy">
    <div class="extension-product-top"><div class="extension-product-name">Descargar Pinterest</div><span class="extension-live">Chrome</span></div>
    <p>Descarga vídeos, imágenes y GIF de Pinterest desde la página que estás viendo. Elige un archivo o analiza la página, selecciona varios resultados y guárdalos por separado o en ZIP.</p>
    <div class="extension-features"><span class="extension-feature">Un archivo</span><span class="extension-feature">Analizar página</span><span class="extension-feature">Selección múltiple</span><span class="extension-feature">Original</span><span class="extension-feature">ZIP</span></div>
    <div class="extension-actions">
      <a class="extension-btn primary" href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/pinterest-downloader/nmpahchhmcdejmfcmkphnbhckmlhhnon?utm_source=layerporter&amp;utm_medium=website&amp;utm_campaign=extensions_hub_es" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Añadir a Chrome ↗</a>
      <a class="extension-btn secondary" href="/es/pinterest-downloader/">Ver detalles →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<article class="extension-product">
  <div class="extension-product-visual converter" aria-label="Conversor de Imágenes">
    <div class="ux-window">
      <div class="ux-window-head"><div class="ux-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="ux-url">example.com / product-image.webp</div><div class="ux-extension-icon"><img src="/picture-converter/welcome/picture-converter-icon.png" alt="" width="21" height="21" decoding="async" /></div></div>
      <div class="pc-workspace">
        <div class="pc-source-card"><span class="pc-source-arrow">←</span><span class="pc-source-copy"><b>Elegir una imagen de un sitio web</b><small>Importar una imagen desde la página actual</small></span><span class="pc-source-icon"><img src="/picture-converter/welcome/picture-converter-icon.png" alt="" width="25" height="25" decoding="async" /></span></div>
        <div class="pc-main">
          <div class="pc-stage"><div class="pc-gallery-icon">▧</div><strong>Arrastra y suelta una imagen aquí</strong><p>o elige un archivo de tu ordenador</p><button class="pc-choose" type="button" tabindex="-1">Elegir una imagen</button><div class="pc-formats-title">Formatos de entrada compatibles</div><div class="pc-inputs"><span>PNG</span><span>JPG</span><span>WebP</span><span>HEIC</span><span>AVIF</span><span>GIF</span><span>BMP</span><span>JFIF</span><span>SVG</span><span>+1</span></div></div>
          <div class="pc-settings">
            <div class="pc-output-formats"><span class="pc-format active">PNG ✓</span><span class="pc-format">JPG</span><span class="pc-format">WEBP</span><span class="pc-format">PDF</span><span class="pc-format">ICO</span></div>
            <div class="pc-option"><div class="pc-option-row"><span>Calidad</span><span>92%</span></div><div class="pc-range"></div></div>
            <button class="pc-download" type="button" tabindex="-1">↓ Descargar PNG</button>
            <div class="pc-summary"><b>Entrada</b> WebP · 1600×1200<br /><b>Salida</b> PNG · 1600×1200</div>
            <div class="pc-local">Procesado localmente. No se sube nada.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="extension-product-copy">
    <div class="extension-product-top"><div class="extension-product-name">Conversor de Imágenes</div><span class="extension-live">Chrome</span></div>
    <p>Elige una imagen de un sitio web o abre un archivo local y guarda el resultado como PNG, JPG, WebP, PDF o ICO. Los archivos locales se procesan en tu dispositivo.</p>
    <div class="extension-features"><span class="extension-feature">Desde una web</span><span class="extension-feature">Desde el ordenador</span><span class="extension-feature">PNG / JPG / WebP</span><span class="extension-feature">PDF / ICO</span><span class="extension-feature">Local</span></div>
    <div class="extension-actions">
      <a class="extension-btn primary" href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/image-converter/ooiklbnjmhbcfnllkgjahadblibecgfj?utm_source=layerporter&amp;utm_medium=website&amp;utm_campaign=extensions_hub_es" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Añadir a Chrome ↗</a>
      <a class="extension-btn secondary" href="/picture-converter/">Ver detalles →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
</section>
<p class="extensions-note">Cada extensión tiene una página propia con todas sus funciones y flujos de trabajo.</p>
</div>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer"><div class="wrap"><p>LayerPorter — extensiones de navegador y herramientas online</p><nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="Footer"><a href="/about/">Acerca de</a><span>·</span><a href="/es/extensions/">Extensiones</a><span>·</span><a href="/privacy/">Privacidad</a><span>·</span><a href="/terms/">Términos</a></nav></div></footer>
</body>
</html>